@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
title RetailFlow - return state machine
[*] --> APPROVED : eligible standard request
[*] --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : amount > 500000 VND or DAMAGED
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> APPROVED : independent manager approves / reason
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> REJECTED : manager rejects / release units
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> CANCELLED : authorized cancellation / release units
APPROVED --> CANCELLED : authorized pre-inspection cancellation / release
APPROVED --> ACCEPTED : STORE / passed inspection
APPROVED --> DISPUTED : STORE / discrepancy / hold units
ACCEPTED --> COMPLETED : confirmed refund SUCCEEDED
REJECTED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
note right of DISPUTED
  Unresolved hold; payment blocked.
  Dispute resolution is outside v1.0.
end note
note right of ACCEPTED
  Payment FAILED, UNKNOWN or PENDING
  does not release accepted goods.
  No post-inspection cancellation.
end note
@enduml
